Content-Type: application/json

{
  "problemId": 2,
  "userId": 1,
  "userAnswers": [
    "1",
    "2"
  ]
}

### 문제 제출 - 복수선택 부분 오답 (정답+오답 혼합)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/problems/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "problemId": 2,
  "userId": 1,
  "userAnswers": [
    "1",
    "3"
  ]
}

